#ASSERT NOT (`s 23.2(1) benefits are payable to the claimant to care for or support a critically ill child` TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 23.2(1) benefits are payable to the claimant to care for or support a critically ill child` TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 23.2(1) benefits are payable to the claimant to care for or support a critically ill child` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 23.2(1) benefits are payable to the claimant to care for or support a critically ill child` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 23.2(1) benefits are payable to the claimant to care for or support a critically ill child` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE)

§ `s 23.2(3) the period for a critically ill child (src:615-622)`
-- Certificate issued and filed on Wednesday 2026-04-15 (the week of Sunday 2026-04-12): 52 weeks end on Saturday 2027-04-10.
-- args: the day the first certificate is issued and filed; the day the practitioner certifies from (claim made first); (5) takes (3)(a)(ii) out; the day benefits are exhausted; the day the child dies
#ASSERT (`s 23.2(3) the period during which benefits are payable` (YearMonthDay 2026 4 15) NOTHING FALSE NOTHING NOTHING)'s `first day of the period` EQUALS YearMonthDay 2026 4 12
#ASSERT (`s 23.2(3) the period during which benefits are payable` (YearMonthDay 2026 4 15) NOTHING FALSE NOTHING NOTHING)'s `last day of the period` EQUALS YearMonthDay 2027 4 10
-- the child dies on Wednesday 2026-07-01: the period ends on Saturday 2026-07-04
#ASSERT (`s 23.2(3) the period during which benefits are payable` (YearMonthDay 2026 4 15) NOTHING FALSE NOTHING (JUST (YearMonthDay 2026 7 1)))'s `last day of the period` EQUALS YearMonthDay 2026 7 4
-- benefits exhausted on Wednesday 2026-05-06: Saturday 2026-05-09
#ASSERT (`s 23.2(3) the period during which benefits are payable` (YearMonthDay 2026 4 15) NOTHING FALSE (JUST (YearMonthDay 2026 5 6)) NOTHING)'s `last day of the period` EQUALS YearMonthDay 2026 5 9
-- the claim was made before the certificate was issued: from Wednesday 2026-03-11 (week of Sunday 2026-03-08), unless (5) applies
#ASSERT (`s 23.2(3) the period during which benefits are payable` (YearMonthDay 2026 4 15) (JUST (YearMonthDay 2026 3 11)) FALSE NOTHING NOTHING)'s `first day of the period` EQUALS YearMonthDay 2026 3 8
#ASSERT (`s 23.2(3) the period during which benefits are payable` (YearMonthDay 2026 4 15) (JUST (YearMonthDay 2026 3 11)) TRUE NOTHING NOTHING)'s `first day of the period` EQUALS YearMonthDay 2026 4 12

